<title>UK: INSIGHT - GOLD TO RANGE, DIRECTION STILL UNCLEAR.</title>
<headline>INSIGHT - GOLD TO RANGE, DIRECTION STILL UNCLEAR.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p> SPOT     NY CLOSE  * SUPPORT * RESIST * RSI14 *   MA10 *   MA30</p>
<p> GOLD   321.70/2.00 *  321.00 * 328.00 *    43 * 323.84 * 324.02</p>
<p> SILVER   4.39/4.41 *    4.30 *   4.48 *    48 *   4.39 *   4.39</p>
<p> PLAT   432.00/3.00 *  420.00 * 455.00 *    55 * 434.24 * 419.06</p>
<p>-----------------VIEWS FROM THE MARKET - Aug 8 ---------------</p>
<p>Gold bullion prices are likely to settle into a range-trading pattern on Friday, having established a base on Thursday around $318.00, analysts said.</p>
<p>Overall direction remains unclear, however, with speculative interest seen on both sides of the market. Silver will range around $4.40, while PGMs will continue volatile.</p>
